  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4202.51 Residential use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4202.51 “Residential use” means use in an area where people reside, dwell, or lodge, including but not limited to single- and multiple-family dwellings, condominiums, mobile homes, manufactured housing, apartment complexes, motels, and hotels.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06, ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15 (formerly Env-A 4202.01(ay)); ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4200.html"
